  "title": "The Complete Alice in Wonderland - The Tarts (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "The Tarts\n\n(Mother Goose)\n\nThe Queen of Hearts,\n\nShe made some tarts,\n\nAll on a summer’s day;\n\nThe Knave of Hearts,\n\nHe stole the tarts,\n\nAnd took them clean away.\n\nThe King of Hearts\n\nCalled for the tarts,\n\nAnd beat the Knave full sore;\n\nThe Knave of Hearts\n\nBrought back the tarts,\n\nAnd vowed he’d steal no more.",
